      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
         "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>Whenever the Drukhari kills an individual, roll a d10. All Drukhari present gain the rolled effect until the end of the encounter. Each effect can only be gained once per encounter. 1-2 Inured to Suffering: All Drukhari present have Advantage on Fortitude Tests. 3-4 Eager to Flay: All Drukhari present gain +1SL to Melee Attack Tests when they Charge. 5-6 Flensing Fury: All Drukhari present increase the Rend Trait on their bladed melee weapons by 2. 7-8 Mantle of Agony: All Drukhari present gain +1 Armor. 9-0 Emboldened by Bloodshed: All Drukhari present have Advantage on Discipline Tests.</p>"
        },
